WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.915
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with

00:00:04.915 --> 00:00:06.003
communities across Africa.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:09.405
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting.

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.152
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:20.358
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it. Explain one respectful

00:00:20.358 --> 00:00:23.225
similarity or difference with another African example.
